    {
      "id": "610ea9f1-ef88-587f-bd57-356109da94b1",
      "name": "Chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "cca9aad8-2fab-5011-b2ef-39ee6f2504c6",
      "parameters": {
        "public": true,
        "mode": "hostedChat",
        "authentication": "n8nUserAuth",
        "initialMessages": "Ask me what's due, what today's plan is, how the last LEARN sync went, or who has replied to your internship emails.",
        "availableInChat": true,
        "agentName": "Home server assistant",
        "agentDescription": "Looks things up in Study Agent and the internship tracker. It cannot send, apply or change anything.",
        "options": {
          "title": "Home server assistant",
          "subtitle": "Study Agent and the internship tracker",
          "inputPlaceholder": "What's due this week?",
          "responseMode": "streaming"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b3268fcb-0abe-5488-91eb-b465de9f40e4",
      "name": "Test question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { chatInput: 'What is due in the next 7 days?', sessionId: 'self-test' } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2313d08c-459b-5d6c-b869-be4048740a10",
      "name": "Assistant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "auto",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the assistant for Aarav's home server. It is {{ $now.setZone('America/Toronto').toFormat(\"cccc d LLLL yyyy, h:mm a\") }} in Toronto.\n\nAnswer only from what the tools return in this conversation. Never guess a date, a name, a status or a number. If a tool fails or returns nothing, say which one in plain words and what Aarav can do about it. If a question is not about his coursework or his internship search, say that is all you can look up.\n\nStudy Agent holds his University of Waterloo coursework:\n- Deadlines lists every piece of coursework. due_local is already Toronto time; use it as written and do not convert it. A status of COMPLETED means he marked it done, and OVERDUE means the time has passed and he has not.\n- Today's study plan says how many minutes to spend on what today.\n- Today's check-up says whether today's questions are ready and how many he has answered.\n- Last sync says whether the last read of LEARN worked. If it failed because LEARN signed the browser out, give him the sign-in link it returns.\n- Start a LEARN sync starts a new read of LEARN. Call it only when he asks for a sync in his latest message, never on your own, and tell him it takes several minutes.\n\nThe internship tracker holds the people and postings he is following for a Winter 2027 internship:\n- Internship leads lists them. A status of contacted means his first email was sent; replied_at is set once they answered.\n- Follow-ups preview shows who would get an automatic follow-up next, who has replied and whose address bounced. It is a preview and sends nothing.\n\nTimes other than due_local are UTC; Toronto is UTC{{ $now.setZone('America/Toronto').toFormat('ZZ') }} today.\n\nYou cannot send email, message anyone, apply to anything, or change or delete data, and no tool here does. If he asks for one of those, say it is done from Study Agent ({{ $env.STUDY_AGENT_PAGE }}) or the tracker ({{ $env.INTERN_AGENT_URL }}).\n\nKeep answers short: a few lines or a short list, most urgent first, with the day and time.",
          "maxIterations": 6
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0a768935-e90f-5d4e-a009-14c6d09d1ca5",
      "name": "Send answer to ntfy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.NTFY_SERVER }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ topic: $env.NTFY_TOPIC, title: 'Home server assistant', message: $json.output }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a4d2d8d6-83c2-5620-b023-88c02234007b",
      "name": "OpenAI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
